      {
        "text": "The unreferenced discussions overlap only through shared code. PR #26, \u201cSuperior 3INST parameters,\u201d proposes a decoder multiplier; the inspected converter passes multiplier settings to its quantizer. Issue #33, \u201cError converting model,\u201d reports a Qwen conversion file-open error through `get_tensors`/`get_tensor`. Issue #34, \u201ctorch._C._LinAlgError on last layer of quant,\u201d reports a Cholesky failure; #42, \u201cconverting to 3.0 bpw causes error; block state has 0 inf values and 34 NaN values,\u201d reports a bitrate-specific Midnight-Miqu failure; and #52, \u201cError converting moonshotai/Kimi-Dev-72B,\u201d reports Cholesky failures at some bitrates. Their traces include the inspected converter's `linear.convert_exl3` call. Issue #53, \u201cCommand A support,\u201d asks for Command A support and available EXL3 weights, not for an Ernie fix; its overlap is the shared conversion workflow. These are inferred associations, not reproductions or evidence of the author's motivation.",
